// generated from voice/SCRIPTS.md: line key -> text
export default {"marta_01": "You found the Exit Sign. Glowing, isn’t it? It doesn’t go anywhere. It never did. The real way down is the stairwell door behind me, and it’s chained shut. Sergeant Pylon holds the key and charges a toll in cones. Kill him, or make him a deal. Pickles has been sniffing around his goblins.", "marta_02": "Bathrobe and a lighter. You must be fresh off the stairs. Breathe. Everyone gets the same broadcast and everyone ends up here, in Stairwell Camp. It’s the only safe ground on this floor. Monsters won’t come inside the lights.", "marta_03": "Get stronger before you go wandering. The goblin packs near camp are weak; the ones further out are not. Kill, loot, level up. Eat and drink or you’ll fade. Craft what you can’t buy. And when you’re ready, the stairwell behind me goes down. It’s chained. Ask me about that later.", "marta_04": "Eighteen floors. Every contestant thinks they’ll be the one. The network says people have finished, but nobody’s ever met one. I want to know why. Get down there and find out, and if you can, send word back.", "marta_05": "It will be. Come back when it is.", "marta_06": "The network did. They like a toll gate. Makes for good television. Pylon just took the job.", "marta_07": "Goblins out of Pylon Point raid our water line. Two ways I can use you. Thin out their packs, or find out where our water’s actually going. The Ramp Spiral, maybe, or that bus that never stops burning.", "marta_08": "Ha. You’ve got a face people want to help. Don’t waste it. Here: two potions and some water. Don’t tell the others.", "marta_09": "Supplies are for people who’ve earned them. Go earn them.", "pickles_01": "Twelve! Lovely, lovely plastic. Right, the reasons. Pylon’s planning to cone off the whole stairwell. Toll forever. No one in, no one out, unless you pay in cones. I can make him an offer he likes. Or you can make him an example.", "pickles_02": "You did it! Pylon’s cones are on the open market! I mean, I have them. Here, a crown. Made it myself. From him.", "pickles_03": "Pickles’ Junk! Everything’s junk! Some of it’s good junk!", "pickles_04": "Reasons! Business reasons! Bring me twelve chunks of cone plastic and I’ll tell you the reasons. The goblins drop it. Mostly when they’re on fire.", "pickles_05": "Still thinking? The offer stands. A hundred gold and the goblins love you. Or no gold, and one dead sergeant.", "bo_01": "My box! And springs! You lovely lunatic. From now on you get the friends-and-family rate. Twenty percent off every table.", "bo_02": "Bo’s Benches. Tables built to last, delivered to your Crash Pad. Mostly in one piece.", "bo_03": "Each table makes its own things. Sixty recipes apiece, five tiers. Upgrade a table to unlock the next tier. And put tables next to each other: an Alchemy Lab beside a Boom Bench lets you brew firebombs. Tables talk to each other. Not literally. Mostly.", "bo_04": "My toolbox. Dropped it out by the Ramp Spiral, and some goblin nicked the springs out of it. Bring me the box and three springs and I’ll give you the friends-and-family rate.", "wickley_01": "Well? You tasted both. Grandma Gristle’s broth is old magic, all bones and grudges. Auntie Brine’s chowder is new money, salt and spite. One of them has to lose or the whole Row goes up in toxic fog every Dinner Bell. Whose pot do we spoil?", "wickley_02": "The Cone King is dead?! The goblins are already crowning a new one out back. Doesn’t matter. The stairs are open. Go on, before someone charges you a toll.", "wickley_03": "Welcome to Soup Row! Best soup on Floor 3, worst soup on Floor 3, depends which day. I’m Wickley. What’ll it be?", "wickley_04": "Hags. Two families, two kitchens, one feud. Every Dinner Bell their pots boil over and the fog comes rolling up the alleys. Taste both and tell me which one we ruin.", "wickley_05": "Under the Cone Cathedral, south end. The Cone King sits on the stairs like a hen on an egg. He was Pylon’s boss, and he’s heard what happened to Pylon.", "ash_01": "You saw her. The Bulb Queen, on her chandelier. She isn’t cruel. She’s hungry for light, and we keep the lanterns lit all night. I could make her an offering, a bulb that never burns out. Or you could end her.", "ash_02": "It is done. The district is darker tonight, and quieter. Take her filament. Keep it lit for her.", "ash_03": "Peace, traveller. I keep the Last Light, the lantern at the heart of the Row. Lately the moths come for it every night.", "ash_04": "They follow their Queen, and she lives in the Lamp Market to the north-east. Find her. See what she is. Then we decide.", "vrask_01": "Ah. A contestant. I am Judge Vrask, critic for the Soup District cook-off. I have come a very long way to be disappointed. Impress me.", "vrask_02": "Hm. *He tastes it, slowly.* Grease. Despair. A hint of rat. It is… actually remarkable. Five stars. The Ascendancy will hear your name.", "vrask_03": "*The judge’s shell flickers.* …You are perceptive. Yes. I am a guest. We all watch, out there, nine nations of us. And on the sixth floor, some of us stop watching and start hunting. You did not hear this from me.", "vrask_04": "I am a judge. Of soup. Please stop staring at my shell.", "bix_01": "Bix. Bo’s cousin. The soup branch. Tables, delivered greasy.", "pip_01": "Oh! A new one! Hi! Welcome to the Network Orientation Centre! I’m Pip, I’m an intern, I’m not paid, I’m also technically a contestant. Before you go down to Floor One I have to make sure you know how to, um, not die. Immediately.", "pip_02": "You drank, you unboxed, you hit a dummy! You’re a natural. Now the fun part: the practice arena through that door. Cardboard goblins. They hit back, but softly. Watch the floor: when red fills up under them, step out of it, dodge with V, or tap F as it fills to parry.", "pip_03": "Look at you! Okay, last thing: everyone wakes up with no class. You get to choose a race and a class at the Hall of Callings on Floor Three. Until then it’s you, that pipe, and your lighter. The stairs down are at the end of the hall. Good luck. Please don’t die, the paperwork is awful.", "pip_04": "Under your old building! Every stairwell on Earth leads here now. This is the Landing. It’s safe. Below this, nothing is safe. That’s the show!", "pip_05": "Three things! One: you get thirsty and hungry down here, so drink from the fountain. Two: I left you a Welcome Box, press I to open your bag and click it. Three: hit a training dummy with your pipe, left click, a few times. Then come back to me.", "pip_06": "Red is health, blue is mana, green is stamina for sprinting and heavy swings. The two little bars are hunger and thirst. Top right is your map, M for the big one. L shows your quests. And the yellow bar at the very bottom is experience.", "callings_01": "Welcome back, …. The Hall only records a calling once. Your guild hall is across the square; they’ll have work for you.", "callings_02": "Welcome to the Hall of Callings. Every contestant who reaches the third floor gets to choose what they are: a race and a class. Twelve schools of magic and eight trades. Choose carefully. It’s permanent, and the audience is watching.", "callings_03": "Fire, wind, ice, lightning, earth, water, death, light, curses, time, spores, and the spellsword, who does a bit of everything with a blade. Mages hit hard from a distance and run out of mana. Trades are tougher up close. Everyone gets three skills to start and learns more from skill books.", "innkeeper_01": "Room for the night? Ten gold. You’ll wake up rested, fed and watered. Mostly watered.", "sunny_01": "THAT was content! The Kraken, on camera, in pieces! Your sponsor is thrilled. Here is your bonus, minus my commission.", "sunny_02": "Your sponsor, …, says hi! And to please stop bleeding on their logo.", "sunny_03": "Hiiii! Sunny, Sponsor Relations! You are trending, and three sponsors want you. Pick one. They each want different content, and they will remember.", "prickle_01": "You found him? A little gnome in a too-big hoodie, eating a pretzel? Yes, that is Timmy. He is two hundred years old. He thanks you.", "prickle_02": "I read palms, coupons and the tannoy. The Lost Child announcements? Real. Every one. There is a Timmy, and he is hiding somewhere in the mall.", "deb_01": "The President’s gone? The fines are gone? Somebody hug me. Not you, you’re covered in gnome.", "deb_02": "I’m Big Deb. I run the fort. The HOA President fined us for “excessive survival.” The manhole down to the next floor is in their clubhouse.", "watch_01": "The collar. “MR. FETCH. IF FOUND, PLEASE RETURN.” He was somebody’s good boy once. Show it to him? He might remember. Or he might eat you.", "watch_02": "Neighbourhood Watch. We watch. That’s all we do. Mr. Fetch at the Dog Park, we watched him change. He had a collar once.", "gusset_01": "Five hunters down. The lodges are furious. Good. Now finish it: the Glimmerkin Safari Lodge runs the whole season.", "gusset_02": "The Lord-Hunter is down. The tourists are packing their bags. The Canopy is ours again. For now.", "gusset_03": "Gusset, warden of the Treehouse. It’s hunting season. Out there, tourists from the audience have licences to hunt us. Contestants, I mean. You.", "lantern_01": "You saw them. The same marks as on the third floor? Then someone is following the show who isn’t part of it. Keep looking, little flame.", "lantern_02": "I am the eldest of the Mothwing. There are marks at the foot of the Tallest Tree. Not ours, not the Network’s. Will you look?", "bev_01": "Bev’s Benches, the wet branch. Same tables as my brother Bo, damper delivery.", "spin_01": "You got the coin jars! Into the machine they go… and… DAVE! Dave’s out! He’s a bit dented. He says thanks. He also says he’s opening a snack stand.", "spin_02": "Dave’s snacks are back on! Want some?", "spin_03": "Welcome to the Laundromat! Wash, dry, despair. I’m Spin. Have you seen Dave? Dave’s inside. The coin machine at the back ate him.", "spin_04": "It wants coins! A hundred and fifty gold would do it. Or, the thieves out there nicked my coin jars. Knock out ten of them and I’ll have enough.", "reggie_01": "His timecard. Clocked in forty years ago. Never clocked out. He’s still down there doing his rounds. Should I go to him? Talk to him? Or should you end it?", "reggie_02": "It’s done, then. He can rest. Take his keys. He’d want them used.", "reggie_03": "Forty years I mopped these floors with Ebb. Then the Boiler Room took him. He’s still in there. Still on shift.", "reggie_04": "Find his timecard. It’ll be by the punch clock in Boiler Room 0. If he never clocked out, maybe that’s why he can’t stop.", "dale_01": "I’ll deal with Pylon.", "dale_02": "Who chained it?", "dale_03": "Take the key.", "dale_04": "Glad to help.", "dale_05": "What do I do now?", "dale_06": "Why has nobody reached the bottom?", "dale_07": "Got any work for me?", "dale_08": "[Charisma 11] Any spare supplies for a new arrival?", "dale_09": "Patch me up. (10 gold)", "dale_10": "Goodbye.", "dale_11": "Got it. Thanks, Marta.", "dale_12": "I’ll find out.", "dale_13": "Not my problem.", "dale_14": "Fine. I’ll look into it.", "dale_15": "Leave.", "dale_16": "Then I’ll deal with Pylon.", "dale_17": "I’ll thin out the packs.", "dale_18": "I’ll find the leak.", "dale_19": "Neither, for now.", "dale_20": "Thanks, Marta.", "dale_21": "Fair enough.", "dale_22": "Make him the offer. (Pay 100 gold)", "dale_23": "Make him an example.", "dale_24": "I’ll think about it.", "dale_25": "It’s… very orange.", "dale_26": "Show me your junk.", "dale_27": "Why are you buying traffic cones?", "dale_28": "About Pylon…", "dale_29": "Twelve cones. Got it.", "dale_30": "Sounds shady.", "dale_31": "Make the offer. (Pay 100 gold)", "dale_32": "I’ll take him down.", "dale_33": "Later.", "dale_34": "Pleasure doing business.", "dale_35": "Show me the tables.", "dale_36": "How do crafting tables work?", "dale_37": "You look like you lost something.", "dale_38": "Thanks.", "dale_39": "I’ll find it.", "dale_40": "Not today.", "dale_41": "Sabotage Grandma Gristle.", "dale_42": "Sabotage Auntie Brine.", "dale_43": "[Charisma 15] Make them cook together instead.", "dale_44": "See you on the next floor.", "dale_45": "What’s wrong with the soup?", "dale_46": "How do I get down to Floor 4?", "dale_47": "I’ll taste them.", "dale_48": "I don’t eat hag food.", "dale_49": "Then he’s next.", "dale_50": "Make her an offering. (4 Glass Shard, 2 Battery)", "dale_51": "I’ll end her.", "dale_52": "Let me think.", "dale_53": "Rest well, Queen.", "dale_54": "Why do the moths attack?", "dale_55": "I’ll find her.", "dale_56": "Not now.", "dale_57": "Taste my cooking.", "dale_58": "What do I need to do?", "dale_59": "[Charisma 14] You’re not from the dungeon, are you?", "dale_60": "Bribe the judge. (200 gold)", "dale_61": "Thank you, Judge.", "dale_62": "Your secret’s safe.", "dale_63": "Sorry.", "dale_64": "Okay. What do I need to know?", "dale_65": "Where am I, exactly?", "dale_66": "Let’s go.", "dale_67": "Thanks, Pip.", "dale_68": "What do the bars on my screen mean?", "dale_69": "Bye, Pip.", "dale_70": "Great. What do I need to know?", "dale_71": "Got it.", "dale_72": "I’m ready to choose.", "dale_73": "Tell me about magic classes.", "dale_74": "Not yet.", "dale_75": "Rest (10 gold): full health, hunger and thirst", "dale_76": "Thanks, Sunny.", "dale_77": "Pretzel Hut (+4 CON forever)", "dale_78": "Electro-Mart (+10% cast speed forever)", "dale_79": "Glamour Shots (+5 CHA forever)", "dale_80": "No sponsor. (Sunny will be sad.)", "dale_81": "You’re welcome, Timmy.", "dale_82": "I’ll find Timmy.", "dale_83": "I’ll cancel the fines.", "dale_84": "Show him the collar.", "dale_85": "He’s too far gone.", "dale_86": "I’ll find the collar.", "dale_87": "I’ll end it.", "dale_88": "For now.", "dale_89": "Then I’ll hunt them back.", "dale_90": "I will.", "dale_91": "I’ll look.", "dale_92": "Welcome back, Dave.", "dale_93": "Show me the snacks.", "dale_94": "How do I get him out?", "dale_95": "Here’s 150 gold.", "dale_96": "I’ll get your jars back.", "dale_97": "Maybe later.", "dale_98": "Go talk to him. I’ll keep the wights off you.", "dale_99": "I’m sorry, Reggie.", "dale_100": "What can I do?", "goblin_01": "OI! CONE ZONE!", "goblin_02": "Shiny! MINE!", "goblin_03": "Get the tall one!", "goblin_04": "Hrrk! Fresh meat!", "goblin_05": "Boss said nobody passes!", "thrower_01": "Heads up! HEH HEH.", "thrower_02": "Cone incoming!", "thrower_03": "Catch!", "captain_01": "FORM UP, YOU LOT!", "captain_02": "For the Sergeant!", "captain_03": "You picked the wrong car park.", "wight_01": "...still... on... shift...", "wight_02": "Mind... the... floor...", "wight_03": "Clock... in...", "dummy_01": "…", "cardboard_01": "Grr! (on cardboard)", "cardboard_02": "Tutorial violence!", "cardboard_03": "I am a training goblin!", "lintKing_01": "Lint… everywhere… mine…", "lintKing_02": "The traps are FULL.", "mothMatron_01": "Who dims my light?", "mothMatron_02": "Children, to me!", "pigeonElder_01": "COOOOO.", "pigeonElder_02": "The loft provides!", "dave_01": "EXACT CHANGE ONLY.", "dave_02": "DAVE IS NOT AVAILABLE.", "dave_03": "PLEASE INSERT CONTESTANT.", "lostfound_01": "Have you lost something? I have it now.", "lostfound_02": "Unclaimed items will be eaten.", "gristle_01": "Eat your soup, dearie.", "gristle_02": "Second helpings for everyone!", "mallcop_01": "Sir. SIR. No running.", "mallcop_02": "You’re banned from the mall. For life.", "mallcop_03": "Code red. Code ME.", "hound_01": "*BARK BARK BARK*", "hound_02": "*growls at the mailbox*", "hound_03": "*snarl*", "hag_01": "Come closer, sweetie.", "hag_02": "Soup’s almost ready…", "hag_03": "Hee hee hee!", "slime_01": "*boing*", "slime_02": "*wobbly laughter*", "slime_03": "*squelch*", "gnome_01": "Off the lawn!", "gnome_02": "HOA violation!", "gnome_03": "Hee! Hee!", "leech_01": "Limited time offer!", "leech_02": "Buy one, get bitten.", "leech_03": "*paper rustling*", "hunter_01": "There! Trophy at two o’clock!", "hunter_02": "Hold still, contestant.", "hunter_03": "Licence number 4471. You’re on it.", "kevlar_01": "This mall is under MY protection.", "kevlar_02": "Backup! BACKUP!", "notice_01": "THIS IS YOUR FINAL NOTICE.", "notice_02": "Payment is overdue. So are you.", "blob_01": "IT’S MY PARTY!", "blob_02": "Cake! CAKE!", "kraken_01": "ORDER UP.", "kraken_02": "Would you like fries with your doom?", "mallmother_01": "Shhh. Shop, my darlings. Shop forever.", "mallmother_02": "Nobody leaves the mall.", "pope_01": "Kneel, lawn-defiler.", "pope_02": "Bless this garden. Curse you.", "fetch_01": "*the biggest bark you have ever heard*", "fetch_02": "*drops a ball at your feet, menacingly*", "hoa_01": "Your lawn is two millimetres too long.", "hoa_02": "Fined. Fined. FINED.", "mayor_01": "Re-elect me. Forever.", "mayor_02": "This cul-de-sac is a democracy. I am the democracy.", "sludge_01": "Grandma’s soup was always too salty.", "sludge_02": "Stay for dinner. Forever.", "matriarch_01": "*a howl that shakes the leaves*", "huntLord_01": "A contestant in MY lodge? How sporting.", "huntLord_02": "You’ll look wonderful above the fireplace.", "bigSucker_01": "Feeeeed meeee…", "bigSucker_02": "My clutch! Away from my clutch!", "bigSucker_03": "The drains all lead to ME.", "moth_01": "bzzzt… LIGHT…", "moth_02": "The Queen sees you…", "moth_03": "bzz bzz BZZ", "pigeon_01": "COO. COO. COO.", "pigeon_02": "Got any bread?", "pigeon_03": "Mine! MINE! COO!", "mimic_01": "INSERT COIN.", "mimic_02": "OUT OF ORDER. OUT OF PATIENCE.", "mimic_03": "Exact change only. Exact. CHANGE.", "bulbQueen_01": "You stand in MY light.", "bulbQueen_02": "Children! A new lamp has come to play!", "bulbQueen_03": "Every flame belongs to me.", "coo_01": "Off my roof, you whippersnapper!", "coo_02": "In my day we ate gravel and liked it.", "coo_03": "Flock! FLOCK!", "coneKing_01": "KNEEL before the CONE.", "coneKing_02": "Pylon was my sergeant. You will pay his toll in full.", "coneKing_03": "Long live the cone!", "town_guard_01": "Keep your weapons sheathed in camp.", "town_guard_02": "Saw a goblin wearing three cones yesterday. Promoted, I guess.", "town_guard_03": "Quiet night. I hate quiet nights.", "town_guard_04": "Sergeant Pylon charges a toll on the east road. In cones.", "town_guard_05": "Stay inside the lights after dark.", "town_cook_01": "Soup’s on. Don’t ask what kind.", "town_cook_02": "Fresh rat kebabs! Well. Recent.", "town_cook_03": "If it glows, cook it longer.", "town_cook_04": "You look hungry. Everyone looks hungry.", "town_trader_01": "Buying scrap, selling slightly better scrap.", "town_trader_02": "Prices go up when the Host is watching.", "town_trader_03": "No refunds. No returns. No questions.", "town_gossip_01": "Did you hear? Marta says nobody ever reaches the bottom.", "town_gossip_02": "Pickles has been buying cones. Why does he want cones?", "town_gossip_03": "They say the stairwell door only opens if Pylon falls.", "town_gossip_04": "My cousin went down to Floor 2. Came back damp.", "town_gossip_05": "The Host winked at me. I think. Hard to tell with a hologram.", "town_healer_01": "Hold still. This’ll sting. Everything stings.", "town_healer_02": "Drink water. Then drink more water.", "town_healer_03": "Bandages are two copper. Sympathy is free.", "town_quest_01": "Got a minute? No? Later then.", "town_kid_01": "Are you a contestant? Can I have your boots when you die?", "town_kid_02": "I’m gonna be on telly one day!", "town_kid_03": "Race you to the fire!", "town_worker_01": "These tents won’t patch themselves.", "town_worker_02": "Pass me that hammer. No, the other hammer.", "town_worker_03": "Union break in five.", "intro_01": "3:17 in the morning. Somewhere ordinary.", "intro_02": "Dale was asleep. Dale was always asleep at 3:17. He worked nights at a fireworks warehouse, and this was his one night off.", "intro_03": "Then the television switched itself on.", "intro_04": "Good morning, Earth! Sorry about the hour. Big news, huge news!", "intro_05": "Your planet has been acquired by the Network. Congratulations! The surface is being renovated.", "intro_06": "In ten minutes, every building on Earth will fold neatly into the ground. Please do not be inside them.", "intro_07": "Dale looked out of the window. The city was folding itself away like a pop-up book in reverse.", "intro_08": "But here is the good news! Every stairwell on the planet now leads to one place. Downstairs!", "intro_09": "Downstairs is the greatest show in the galaxy. Eighteen floors. Monsters. Loot. Ratings!", "intro_10": "The rules are simple. Go down. Stay alive. Eat, drink, and entertain the audience. They are watching. All of them.", "intro_11": "Reach Floor Eighteen and you win. Nobody has ever reached Floor Eighteen. No pressure!", "intro_12": "Dale had nine minutes, one bathrobe, and the lighter from work.", "intro_13": "It would have to do.", "intro_14": "Stairwells close in sixty seconds! Anyone still upstairs becomes part of the scenery!", "intro_15": "The whole street was running for the same green sign.", "intro_16": "Contestant number four million, one hundred seventeen thousand and twenty-one. Class detected: Pyromancer. Cute.", "intro_17": "Welcome to the dungeon, Dale. Find the camp, find the people, find a way down. And try not to die before the commercial break!"};
